WEBVTT

00:04.462 --> 00:06.923
[intriguing music playing]

00:08.008 --> 00:09.718
[footsteps padding in grass]

00:13.388 --> 00:15.598
LUCKY JERK

00:20.228 --> 00:21.688
[pitiful meowing]

00:21.771 --> 00:22.605
Huh?!

00:22.689 --> 00:23.940
[pitiful meowing]

00:26.109 --> 00:27.861
[pitiful meowing]

00:28.445 --> 00:29.863
Oh my!

00:29.946 --> 00:31.865
[mournful meowing]

00:31.948 --> 00:33.700
How cute!

00:33.783 --> 00:36.119
What's wrong? Are you all alone?

00:36.202 --> 00:37.120
[pitiful meowing]

00:37.203 --> 00:38.955
[ragged breathing]

00:39.039 --> 00:39.873
Huh?

00:39.956 --> 00:41.416
[unsettling music playing]

00:41.499 --> 00:43.084
[ragged breathing continues]

00:45.754 --> 00:48.173
- [girl gasps fearfully]
- [ragged breathing]

00:48.256 --> 00:50.425
Please help me.

00:54.095 --> 00:55.138
MONSTER APPEARS IN FOREST?

00:55.221 --> 00:58.308
[man] This is today's newspaper!
Look at this article.

00:58.391 --> 00:59.601
LURES GIRLS WITH A CUTE ANIMAL

00:59.684 --> 01:03.313
Could this be the "animal
that gives life" that En kept as a pet?

01:03.396 --> 01:06.524
What was it called, Chawantake?

01:06.608 --> 01:07.817
It's Kikurage.

01:07.901 --> 01:09.986
Good work! You may go now!

01:10.070 --> 01:11.988
- [man] Yes sir!
- [Natsuki grunting]

01:12.072 --> 01:14.824
It's easier to get information
with more people.

01:14.908 --> 01:18.078
Our organization
is getting bigger and bigger.

01:18.745 --> 01:19.704
Even now,

01:19.788 --> 01:23.583
workers are running at full capacity
tattooing new cross marks.

01:24.417 --> 01:26.961
What are you trying to do
back there, Natsuki?

01:27.045 --> 01:29.839
[chuckles] I thought maybe
some smoke would come out.

01:29.923 --> 01:33.843
All right, Ton. Go to that forest
and investigate this for us.

01:33.927 --> 01:35.095
Roger!

01:35.178 --> 01:39.432
Kikurage might get scared and run away
if Ton goes there alone.

01:40.225 --> 01:41.976
Natsuki, you go too.

01:42.060 --> 01:43.478
Huh? You want me?

01:43.561 --> 01:47.148
I'm sure the boss would want
to obtain Kikurage's Magic.

01:47.649 --> 01:50.985
Keep an eye out for this "monster."
I'm counting on you.

01:51.069 --> 01:52.362
[gasps happily] Right!

01:53.530 --> 01:55.365
[frantic electronic music playing]

02:07.919 --> 02:09.337
[lyrics in Japanese]

03:20.950 --> 03:21.993
THE BEGINNING

03:22.076 --> 03:22.911
[music fades]

03:22.994 --> 03:24.412
PAYMENT

03:25.038 --> 03:26.748
All right, this is the forest.

03:26.831 --> 03:30.251
The newspaper report said
they were somewhere near the stream.

03:30.335 --> 03:31.836
[uneasy music playing]

03:33.254 --> 03:34.422
[Natsuki sighs]

03:35.006 --> 03:36.299
What's wrong, Natsuki?

03:36.382 --> 03:37.800
Oh, uh,

03:37.884 --> 03:41.763
it's just about that smoke test
that you did for me the other day...

03:41.846 --> 03:42.680
Oh.

03:43.640 --> 03:46.684
For some reason,
you got some pretty good numbers.

03:46.768 --> 03:48.269
If you're curious,

03:48.353 --> 03:50.772
I'll test you in more detail
back at the mansion.

03:50.855 --> 03:52.440
[gasps excitedly] That would be great!

03:52.523 --> 03:55.360
I want to be as useful
as possible to the boss!

03:55.944 --> 03:58.738
I'll get stronger!
Just like you and the others, Ton.

03:58.821 --> 04:01.908
[Ton] Well, for now, it doesn't seem like
there's much you can do.

04:01.991 --> 04:03.201
[Natsuki] Hey!

04:05.286 --> 04:07.330
[Fujita gasps, groans softly]

04:07.413 --> 04:08.456
[Ebisu giggling]

04:08.539 --> 04:12.210
Jeez, she loves crawling
through these tight spaces, huh?

04:13.211 --> 04:15.505
- [giggles]
- Was there someone just here?

04:15.588 --> 04:18.216
[Ebisu giggling] I've got a blister...

04:18.299 --> 04:21.844
[Fujita] I wish Kikurage had bigger legs.
This is taking forever.

04:22.512 --> 04:24.931
[groans tiredly]
It's already been four days.

04:25.014 --> 04:27.600
[Ebisu chuckles] My heel is bleeding.

04:27.684 --> 04:28.559
[Ebisu giggling]

04:28.643 --> 04:31.980
[Fujita] Remember, this is all about
reviving the En Family!

04:34.524 --> 04:36.484
5 DAYS AGO

04:36.567 --> 04:38.319
[groaning, murmuring]

04:39.070 --> 04:40.113
[dog barking]

04:40.196 --> 04:42.740
[Fujita] It can't be! The En mansion...

04:42.824 --> 04:45.994
I can't believe they took
our mansion away from us...

04:46.661 --> 04:49.163
[Sho] Are these
the only ones who survived?

04:49.706 --> 04:53.001
[Ebisu] What a bunch
of half-dead losers. [giggling]

04:53.835 --> 04:54.919
[Turkey] Thank you.

04:55.003 --> 04:58.506
Because of you and your Magic,
we were able to escape the mansion.

04:59.340 --> 05:01.426
If you hadn't shown up,

05:01.509 --> 05:04.470
everybody here
would certainly be dead right now.

05:04.971 --> 05:08.099
[Sho] Even so,
I could've saved more people...

05:08.599 --> 05:09.767
I could have...

05:10.977 --> 05:14.147
- Don't worry. You did more than enough.
- [Ebisu giggling]

05:14.230 --> 05:16.649
Mm... Mr. Turkey, who is this?

05:16.733 --> 05:19.027
You! Have you forgotten me too?

05:19.110 --> 05:20.111
[gasps]

05:20.194 --> 05:21.487
I, uh...

05:21.571 --> 05:23.948
Fujita, you're being extremely rude.

05:24.032 --> 05:26.826
He's been a member
since the family was formed.

05:26.909 --> 05:28.328
His name is...

05:28.870 --> 05:31.456
[hesitating] His name is,

05:31.539 --> 05:33.541
eh, uh...

05:33.624 --> 05:36.044
- [Sho] Never mind.
- [Ebisu giggling]

05:38.212 --> 05:42.133
Before the attack,
I was also able to rescue Shin and Noi.

05:42.216 --> 05:44.260
The Cross-Eyes nearly killed them.

05:44.344 --> 05:48.181
That was how I managed to take something
from the enemy without them knowing.

05:48.848 --> 05:50.683
Mr. En's severed head.

05:50.767 --> 05:51.726
[Fujita yelps]

05:51.809 --> 05:54.437
[Turkey] How wonderful! You got it back!

05:55.021 --> 06:00.318
But the devil tumor inside his head
had already been removed.

06:00.401 --> 06:02.195
- [Ebisu retching]
- [Turkey] No way.

06:02.695 --> 06:04.322
That means En is already...

06:04.405 --> 06:06.908
No, there's still some hope for him.

06:07.533 --> 06:10.578
If we get Mr. En's devil tumor back
from the Cross-Eyes,

06:10.661 --> 06:13.164
ask Noi to repair his body,

06:13.247 --> 06:15.416
and use Kikurage's Magic...

06:15.500 --> 06:17.210
Of course! Uh...

06:17.293 --> 06:20.505
It's too bad
that Kikurage is still missing...

06:20.588 --> 06:21.839
- [Turkey] I see.
- Huh?

06:21.923 --> 06:25.510
[Turkey] That's where my particular skills
come in again.

06:25.593 --> 06:26.803
Exactly.

06:26.886 --> 06:31.099
Fujita, we must find Kikurage.
Can I entrust the search to you?

06:31.182 --> 06:34.602
[determined grunt] I swear, I'll do it!

06:34.685 --> 06:37.522
Whatever it takes to revive Mr. En!

06:39.190 --> 06:40.358
And so here we are,

06:40.942 --> 06:44.612
following the Kikurage doll
that Mr. Turkey made,

06:44.695 --> 06:47.156
but did he have to make her walk so slow?

06:47.240 --> 06:49.117
[Ebisu] It's so bad. [retching]

06:49.200 --> 06:50.535
Ebisu!

06:50.618 --> 06:52.870
Why the hell are you on this mission?!

06:52.954 --> 06:56.499
[Ebisu] I brought snacks
for, for Kikurage...

06:57.125 --> 06:58.418
That's right.

06:58.501 --> 07:01.462
You were always closer to Kikurage
than I was.

07:01.963 --> 07:05.550
All right. Once we find Kikurage,
I'll leave her to you.

07:06.676 --> 07:11.013
[Ebisu shrieking] I, I can't!
My body is at its limit!

07:11.097 --> 07:12.765
- [giggling] Oh?
- [pitiful meowing]

07:12.849 --> 07:13.891
Huh?!

07:13.975 --> 07:16.185
- [ethereal music playing]
- [pitiful meowing]

07:16.269 --> 07:17.395
[Fujita] Is that...?

07:17.478 --> 07:20.189
It's Kikurage's voice! I'm sure of it!

07:20.273 --> 07:22.650
- I'm gonna call this in to Sho!
- [cell phone beeps]

07:22.733 --> 07:25.653
- [Fujita] Kikurage, please be okay.
- Little butt, little butt, little butt.

07:26.404 --> 07:28.531
[pitiful meowing]

07:28.614 --> 07:29.657
[Chota] Kikurage...

07:30.241 --> 07:34.203
You don't need to stay here
with me anymore.

07:34.287 --> 07:36.914
I'm gonna die soon.

07:36.998 --> 07:38.916
[mournful meowing]

07:39.584 --> 07:40.793
Sorry, En.

07:40.877 --> 07:44.213
You entrusted Kikurage to me and me alone,

07:44.297 --> 07:48.426
but in the end,
I couldn't protect her like you expected.

07:48.509 --> 07:51.554
- [sad meowing]
- I found her! That's Kikurage!

07:51.637 --> 07:53.055
Oh, there she is!

07:53.139 --> 07:54.432
The... the Cross-Eyes?

07:54.515 --> 07:56.684
Run, Kikurage! Run!

07:56.767 --> 07:58.436
- [panting, gasps]
- [dramatic music playing]

07:58.519 --> 08:00.438
[chuckles] Don't even try to run.

08:00.521 --> 08:02.190
[fearful gasp, yelping]

08:02.273 --> 08:04.442
[grunts] I reeled her in!

08:04.525 --> 08:07.153
You scumbags! Let go of Kikurage!

08:07.236 --> 08:10.656
How dare you kill my En!
I'll kill you all!

08:10.740 --> 08:12.909
Hey, you're Chota, aren't you?

08:13.409 --> 08:16.162
Your name was on the list
of En family officers.

08:16.954 --> 08:19.290
Guess I'll take your head while I'm at it.

08:19.373 --> 08:21.125
[Chota growls] You bastard!

08:21.209 --> 08:22.418
[Ton] It's okay.

08:22.502 --> 08:25.463
I'll kill you in one shot
so you barley feel a thing.

08:25.546 --> 08:26.547
- [Natsuki] Ton!
- Huh?

08:26.631 --> 08:29.550
This is bad! There's another Kikurage...

08:29.634 --> 08:31.052
What?!

08:31.636 --> 08:33.554
[Kikurage meowing pitifully]

08:33.638 --> 08:36.557
I didn't expect
we'd run into the Cross-Eyes out here.

08:37.391 --> 08:40.978
[concerned sigh] If we don't move,
they'll kill both of them.

08:41.062 --> 08:45.107
At the same time,
I'm not at all confident we can beat them.

08:45.650 --> 08:47.568
[yowling]

08:47.652 --> 08:49.570
[Kikurage continues yowling]

08:49.654 --> 08:51.072
[shrieking]

08:51.781 --> 08:53.366
[Fujita gasps] Ebisu?

08:54.700 --> 08:56.035
[demonic shrieking]

08:58.621 --> 09:00.623
- [Natsuki screams]
- [Ton] What's that?!

09:00.706 --> 09:03.167
- [dramatic music playing]
- [demonic laughter]

09:07.338 --> 09:09.590
- A... a monster?
- Natsuki!

09:09.674 --> 09:11.342
[demonic laughter]

09:11.425 --> 09:12.635
[Kikurage yelps softly]

09:13.678 --> 09:14.595
[gasps]

09:14.679 --> 09:16.305
[demonic laughter]

09:16.389 --> 09:17.473
[Kikurage whimpers]

09:17.557 --> 09:19.767
We got another En family member!

09:19.850 --> 09:21.060
[demonic laughter]

09:21.143 --> 09:23.312
[pained grunt, gasps]

09:23.396 --> 09:25.523
Mr. Chota, are you okay?

09:25.606 --> 09:26.816
Oh, Fujita!

09:26.899 --> 09:29.819
[Fujita] Ebisu just...
What on earth is that?

09:29.902 --> 09:32.822
I'm sure that the devil's hairpin
is still inside her head,

09:32.905 --> 09:36.075
plus the emotional agitation
of seeing Kikurage in danger

09:36.158 --> 09:38.953
must have affected her Magic somehow
to create this!

09:39.036 --> 09:40.329
[Ebisu laughing]

09:40.997 --> 09:42.832
[Natsuki whimpering]

09:44.417 --> 09:45.876
[demonic gasp]

09:51.090 --> 09:52.758
[gasps] Now what is that?

09:55.344 --> 09:57.305
[demonic grunting, laughter]

09:57.805 --> 09:59.307
[rubber rebounding]

10:02.852 --> 10:03.728
[Ebisu chuckling]

10:03.811 --> 10:05.896
Ebisu's attacks have no effect!

10:05.980 --> 10:08.232
My goodness. That's defense-type Magic.

10:08.816 --> 10:12.028
I didn't know there was
a Cross-Eyes who could use it.

10:12.737 --> 10:13.613
[Ebisu gasps]

10:13.696 --> 10:15.489
This is bad. We're out of time!

10:15.573 --> 10:16.991
Ebisu! Oh!

10:17.074 --> 10:20.536
[Sho] Fujita! Is everyone okay?

10:24.457 --> 10:27.126
So this Kikurage was a fake?

10:27.793 --> 10:30.504
But Natsuki is the real surprise.

10:31.213 --> 10:34.759
To think that cut would accidentally
open her smoke veins...

10:35.343 --> 10:39.639
Anyway, Natsuki, I gotta say,
you're useful to the boss now, all right.

10:39.722 --> 10:41.265
Very useful.

10:44.477 --> 10:46.896
ADVANCED MAGIC

10:46.979 --> 10:48.272
[heavy rain pattering]

10:49.982 --> 10:51.400
FLOOD OF CUSTOMERS

10:51.484 --> 10:53.903
RECEPTION

10:53.986 --> 10:55.279
[tense music playing]

10:56.113 --> 10:58.908
Where am I? What is this place?

11:17.677 --> 11:18.803
Huh?

11:29.063 --> 11:30.314
- [lighter flicking]
- Hmm?

11:32.316 --> 11:33.484
[slow exhale]

11:37.405 --> 11:38.698
Who are you?

11:39.198 --> 11:41.117
[headless man gurgling]

11:41.701 --> 11:43.577
Where am I? What is this place?

11:44.161 --> 11:45.955
You're holding out on me, aren't you?

11:46.038 --> 11:47.873
[headless man gurgling]

11:48.541 --> 11:49.375
[gasps]

11:49.458 --> 11:51.210
Will you drop that already?!

11:51.293 --> 11:53.963
I told you,
there's nothing I can do about it.

11:54.547 --> 11:57.967
- I'm not fighting back, end of story!
- [dramatic music playing]

12:02.054 --> 12:03.514
[uneasy music playing]

12:05.474 --> 12:06.475
[thunder rumbling]

12:06.559 --> 12:07.977
[gasps]

12:10.896 --> 12:12.106
- [thunder cracking]
- [gasps]

12:12.189 --> 12:14.191
Y...you're... [gasps]

12:16.318 --> 12:17.194
[Risu] Aikawa.

12:17.278 --> 12:18.446
[gasps]

12:18.529 --> 12:19.822
[Risu] Aikawa.

12:19.905 --> 12:21.323
[Aikawa breathing shakily]

12:22.491 --> 12:25.953
Are you okay?
You were talking a lot in your sleep.

12:26.036 --> 12:27.037
Yeah...

12:27.538 --> 12:30.750
So I guess you have nightmares too, huh?

12:37.298 --> 12:40.468
How are you, Risu?
How's your body feeling now?

12:40.551 --> 12:42.887
I'm feeling much better now, thanks.

12:43.387 --> 12:47.224
Sorry again. You know, you didn't have to
take care of me for two whole days.

12:47.308 --> 12:48.642
Don't worry about it.

12:48.726 --> 12:50.978
Well, I'm off. Be back soon.

12:51.771 --> 12:53.230
- [Risu] Aikawa.
- Hmm?

12:53.856 --> 12:57.860
You're the only person I know
who cares about me enough to stay here.

12:58.486 --> 12:59.570
Thank you.

13:00.488 --> 13:04.116
Well, yeah, what'd you expect?
I'm your partner after all. See ya!

13:04.867 --> 13:06.660
You better get plenty of rest.

13:08.245 --> 13:09.121
[door opening]

13:09.205 --> 13:12.124
TACHIKAWA APARTMENTS

13:12.208 --> 13:13.542
[pensive music playing]

13:14.293 --> 13:17.254
[Aikawa] What was that place
in my dream just now,

13:17.338 --> 13:20.382
and who was that man lighting a cigarette?

13:23.385 --> 13:26.931
Let's forget it.
I don't wanna think about anything.

13:28.474 --> 13:32.436
All I want
is to live a normal life as a Sorcerer,

13:32.520 --> 13:33.729
same as anyone else.

13:34.230 --> 13:36.106
But that has me thinking.

13:37.608 --> 13:41.654
Maybe I shouldn't see Risu anymore.

13:41.737 --> 13:43.155
[groaning]

13:43.239 --> 13:45.032
Another headache...

13:45.115 --> 13:47.535
Damn it. Damn it...

13:48.160 --> 13:50.579
Damn it! [groans, gasping]

13:58.420 --> 14:00.756
[Haru] Put some oil on me, Hayes.

14:00.840 --> 14:01.799
[Kasukabe] Okay.

14:02.633 --> 14:06.554
Haru, is there any point in doing this?
You're a devil.

14:06.637 --> 14:08.556
[Haru] It's to set the mood, baby.

14:08.639 --> 14:10.641
[Jonson chittering softly]

14:12.893 --> 14:15.062
[Haru sighs contentedly] Good job.

14:15.145 --> 14:16.605
[jaunty music playing]

14:16.689 --> 14:18.065
[Haru sighs happily]

14:18.148 --> 14:21.068
You know, Hayes,
I've been thinking this for a while,

14:21.151 --> 14:23.821
but I'm not really into
this look of yours.

14:23.904 --> 14:24.738
Huh?

14:24.822 --> 14:27.199
[Haru] We kinda look like mother and son.

14:27.283 --> 14:28.951
Ultimate Devil power!

14:29.034 --> 14:30.870
[screaming]

14:32.872 --> 14:33.706
Huh?!

14:33.789 --> 14:36.709
Whoa! You turned me into an adult,
just like that!

14:37.459 --> 14:40.087
You even conjured my glasses from nothing.

14:40.170 --> 14:43.674
It feels like every day I spend with you
shatters the part of my mind

14:43.757 --> 14:46.135
that believes in science
further and further.

14:46.218 --> 14:48.846
Hmm. Well, Hayes, how about it?

14:48.929 --> 14:50.222
[Kasukabe gasps nervously]

14:50.723 --> 14:53.475
[Haru] Why don't you come
live with me in hell?

14:53.976 --> 14:56.979
It'll beat living
in that garbage dump Hole.

14:57.479 --> 14:59.023
[Jonson chittering happily]

14:59.106 --> 15:01.734
[Kasukabe] Choosing between hell
or the Hole, huh?

15:02.234 --> 15:03.861
Mm, that's a tough choice.

15:04.862 --> 15:06.947
[demonic voice] You belong to me, human!

15:07.031 --> 15:09.283
You will do as I say! Understand?

15:09.366 --> 15:13.287
- Sudden changes in appearance are jarring.
- [Haru] That was close. Was about to die.

15:14.580 --> 15:17.958
[Kasukabe] Anyway,
it's been on my mind for a while,

15:18.042 --> 15:19.793
but I wanna try and find Ai.

15:19.877 --> 15:23.172
Hmm, is it really
that important to you, honey?

15:23.255 --> 15:26.550
Of course it's important.
If I can prove that it's possible

15:26.634 --> 15:29.303
to be able to turn a human being
into a Sorcerer

15:29.386 --> 15:30.554
through the power of science,

15:30.638 --> 15:33.265
that will have huge implications
on my research!

15:33.349 --> 15:35.142
I get it, I get it...

15:35.225 --> 15:36.894
[bored] I'll help you find him.

15:36.977 --> 15:38.354
Thank you, Haru!

15:38.437 --> 15:41.732
But first, uh,
can you change my body back?

15:41.815 --> 15:43.692
This feels really weird.

15:43.776 --> 15:45.527
[whining] Why?

15:46.153 --> 15:48.656
[doorbell ringing]

15:49.156 --> 15:51.492
- Package for you.
- [Kawajiri] Thank you.

15:52.409 --> 15:54.745
Thank goodness it arrived safe.

15:54.828 --> 15:55.746
Now then...

15:55.829 --> 15:57.498
[rock music playing]

16:06.632 --> 16:08.008
I can't believe it.

16:08.092 --> 16:12.262
She's wearing a suit twice as heavy as
the one used in the regular devil exam,

16:12.346 --> 16:14.515
and it's not giving her
any trouble at all!

16:14.598 --> 16:16.266
[Nikaido breathing heavily]

16:17.601 --> 16:19.019
[Nikaido grunting]

16:19.103 --> 16:22.189
- Next is the rinse!
- [Kawajiri] Nikaido!

16:22.272 --> 16:24.858
- [Nikaido] Huh?
- Come down, let's eat!

16:24.942 --> 16:26.026
[metal rattling]

16:26.110 --> 16:28.028
[frustrated sigh]

16:28.737 --> 16:32.783
[Kawajiri] Ta-da, another hearty meal
of the finest devil-meat cuisine!

16:33.492 --> 16:35.744
We're having devil meat again?

16:35.828 --> 16:38.414
- This is all part of your training.
- Mm...

16:38.497 --> 16:41.417
Wait, this isn't
what I think it is, right?

16:41.500 --> 16:44.712
Sure, it looks gross,
but it tastes fantastic.

16:46.088 --> 16:49.049
Asu, what are we really doing here?

16:49.133 --> 16:51.802
It feels like I'm training
for the Devil exam,

16:52.302 --> 16:55.431
but I'm definitely not planning
to become a devil.

16:55.514 --> 17:00.102
Right, when you were younger,
you couldn't control your Magic.

17:00.602 --> 17:02.062
And I think a big part of why

17:02.146 --> 17:05.149
is because you weren't able
to produce enough smoke.

17:05.232 --> 17:09.528
By training for the devil exam,
that's exactly what you're practicing.

17:09.611 --> 17:10.738
[Nikaido] Hmm...

17:11.905 --> 17:16.035
[Kawajiri] Okay,
try to produce as much smoke as you can.

17:16.118 --> 17:17.161
Right.

17:17.244 --> 17:18.412
[grunting softly]

17:19.496 --> 17:20.789
[gasps, whimpers]

17:21.623 --> 17:22.958
[sobbing softly]

17:23.876 --> 17:25.002
Huh?

17:25.627 --> 17:27.129
Don't be afraid.

17:27.629 --> 17:30.632
You've trained to produce
all the smoke you'll need.

17:30.716 --> 17:33.385
I'm sure that's why you failed
when you were young.

17:33.469 --> 17:34.303
Asu...

17:36.430 --> 17:37.890
[takes deep breath]

17:38.766 --> 17:39.808
[sighs]

17:42.102 --> 17:43.062
[grunts]

17:43.687 --> 17:44.521
[yells softly]

17:44.605 --> 17:45.814
[straining]

17:47.107 --> 17:48.275
[straining]

17:50.194 --> 17:51.028
[grunts]

17:51.111 --> 17:52.404
[gasps, whimpers]

17:52.488 --> 17:53.906
Don't look away from it!

17:53.989 --> 17:56.992
Keep making smoke!
Make as much of it as you can!

17:57.076 --> 17:57.910
[determined grunt]

17:57.993 --> 17:59.453
[metal clanging]

18:02.748 --> 18:05.167
- [gasps] The cube!
- [dramatic music playing]

18:05.250 --> 18:06.919
[Nikaido] It changed?

18:08.003 --> 18:10.130
[Kawajiri] Nikaido, produce more smoke!

18:10.214 --> 18:12.299
I'm sure it'll change even more.

18:13.008 --> 18:13.967
[grunting]

18:14.051 --> 18:15.469
I... can't.

18:16.095 --> 18:17.513
It's too much!

18:18.013 --> 18:18.847
[gasps]

18:20.891 --> 18:22.601
[gasps] Nikaido!

18:23.102 --> 18:24.061
[music stops]

18:25.604 --> 18:26.563
LIBRARY - CAFETERIA

18:26.647 --> 18:29.024
- [jaunty music playing]
- Aikawa, get back here!

18:30.692 --> 18:31.527
[Aikawa] Whoa!

18:31.610 --> 18:33.028
[unsteady moaning]

18:33.529 --> 18:37.074
Hand over the ingredients
for the school lunch, you scumbag!

18:37.157 --> 18:39.785
[Aikawa] Damn it. Looks like I'm cornered...

18:39.868 --> 18:43.539
If you come any closer,
I may fall off the edge and die!

18:43.622 --> 18:45.541
Sounds like a great idea!

18:45.624 --> 18:46.792
Go ahead and die!

18:46.875 --> 18:49.086
Smash your brains against the ground.

18:49.169 --> 18:50.462
[Aikawa] You're awful!

18:50.546 --> 18:51.922
- [wails]
- [cook gasps]

18:52.005 --> 18:53.132
Aikawa?!

18:53.215 --> 18:55.342
[Aikawa] Just kidding!

18:55.425 --> 18:56.885
- Whoa!
- [Aikawa laughing]

18:57.845 --> 18:58.804
Smell ya later!

18:58.887 --> 19:00.472
[seething grunts]

19:01.557 --> 19:02.724
[Aikawa] Mm! Mm!

19:02.808 --> 19:04.810
[cheering, laughter]

19:05.394 --> 19:06.812
[snoring softly]

19:06.895 --> 19:08.105
[music fades]

19:09.898 --> 19:14.153
[Risu] He comes to school,
eats, plays, and sleeps.

19:14.736 --> 19:17.072
He's the same Aikawa as before.

19:18.448 --> 19:19.825
It's hard to accept

19:20.367 --> 19:22.578
he would tell someone about my Magic.

19:22.661 --> 19:25.664
Especially not someone
from the Cross-Eyes.

19:26.957 --> 19:28.458
- Hm? Hey there!
- [gasps]

19:28.542 --> 19:31.461
- Risu, is that you?! It's been a while.
- Shh!

19:31.545 --> 19:32.504
[Aikawa] Risu?

19:33.172 --> 19:34.673
[uneasy music playing]

19:36.216 --> 19:39.678
[Aikawa] I didn't know you were here.
You should've said something!

19:43.098 --> 19:44.057
[Risu] Aikawa,

19:44.683 --> 19:46.727
you're full of mysteries, aren't you?

19:46.810 --> 19:47.728
[Aikawa] Hmm?

19:48.270 --> 19:50.105
Full of mysteries? Like what?

19:50.898 --> 19:53.150
[Risu] Like where you actually live,

19:53.775 --> 19:56.195
or where you make money to eat.

19:56.278 --> 19:58.864
- Basically, everything!
- [gasps]

19:59.448 --> 20:03.619
You've still never told me
what kind of Magic-user you are!

20:03.702 --> 20:06.830
Even though
I haven't hidden anything from you!

20:06.914 --> 20:11.627
Risu, like I told you,
I can only produce a little bit of smoke.

20:11.710 --> 20:13.378
Don't play dumb with me!

20:13.462 --> 20:16.673
You're the only one
I've ever told about my Magic!

20:16.757 --> 20:20.052
But you just had to run
and tell someone my secret.

20:20.135 --> 20:22.137
That's why I was killed!

20:22.221 --> 20:24.890
It's not like that, Risu.
Listen to me. I didn't--

20:24.973 --> 20:27.768
I can't believe
a single damn word you say!

20:27.851 --> 20:28.769
[Aikawa gasps]

20:28.852 --> 20:33.148
The Cross-Eyes will tell me the truth,
even if I have to tear it out of them!

20:33.232 --> 20:35.651
My current power
is more than enough for that.

20:35.734 --> 20:37.402
[Aikawa] Risu! Hey, wait!

20:37.486 --> 20:38.946
[ominous music playing]

20:39.029 --> 20:42.449
Does that mean he's going to En's mansion?

20:48.497 --> 20:50.332
Sorry I pushed you so hard.

20:50.832 --> 20:53.085
It's okay. But I was surprised.

20:53.168 --> 20:55.754
I never thought the cube would transform.

20:56.338 --> 20:58.924
All right,
now what the hell do I have to do

20:59.007 --> 21:00.968
to master all of this Magic?

21:01.051 --> 21:02.010
[Kawajiri] Hmm...

21:04.346 --> 21:07.015
Wait, this reminds me
of something I read about.

21:07.099 --> 21:08.934
It's a similar case to yours.

21:09.935 --> 21:12.020
But it was a long time ago.

21:12.813 --> 21:15.941
If only I could find that book
and read it again somehow...

21:16.024 --> 21:17.276
[Nikaido grunts]

21:17.359 --> 21:19.194
Well, where is it now? Huh?

21:19.278 --> 21:21.571
It's written in devil language.

21:21.655 --> 21:25.075
The only Sorcerer who has it
would be Mr. En!

21:25.158 --> 21:26.702
Back to the mansion, then?

21:27.327 --> 21:28.787
Okay, let's go!

21:29.288 --> 21:30.622
[intriguing music playing]

21:30.706 --> 21:33.834
[Kawajiri] At the moment,
it's been occupied by the Cross-Eyes

21:33.917 --> 21:35.544
It's very dangerous.

21:35.627 --> 21:37.087
Plus, there's a good chance

21:37.170 --> 21:40.882
that they've already identified you
as En's former partner.

21:41.675 --> 21:44.594
So searching the place
for a small book will take time.

21:44.678 --> 21:47.097
That means we'll need
a pretty good disguise.

21:47.180 --> 21:48.473
[Nikaido] A disguise?

21:48.557 --> 21:51.018
Exactly, that's where this comes in.

21:52.477 --> 21:54.062
Once you take off your clothes,

21:54.146 --> 21:57.983
step inside this box, put the bottles
in the machine, and pull the lever.

21:58.066 --> 21:59.026
[Nikaido] Hmm...

22:00.193 --> 22:03.822
What a relief.
I can finally take off this armor.

22:03.905 --> 22:04.740
Huh?

22:05.407 --> 22:08.493
A set of clothes
for me to wear once I've transformed?

22:08.577 --> 22:11.246
Finally, a chance to wear a decent outfit.

22:13.040 --> 22:14.333
Let's see...

22:15.292 --> 22:18.295
Set the bottles here and here...

22:18.795 --> 22:20.213
Guess I pull the lever.

22:21.298 --> 22:22.466
OCCUPIED

22:22.549 --> 22:24.092
[machine rattling]

22:26.219 --> 22:27.054
[grunts]

22:27.554 --> 22:29.389
[machine rattling, clunking]

22:30.057 --> 22:31.933
[buzzer sounding]

22:33.560 --> 22:36.355
- [machine powering down]
- [intriguing music playing]

22:50.077 --> 22:51.119
[music fades]

22:52.662 --> 22:53.914
[Japanese theme song playing]

24:20.709 --> 24:21.918
THE END

24:22.002 --> 24:24.171
[narrator] What we learned in Episode 22.

24:24.254 --> 24:25.922
Sho saved the En family.

24:26.006 --> 24:27.924
Natsuki's Magic repels everything.

24:28.008 --> 24:29.885
Nikaido's Magic is immature.

24:29.968 --> 24:34.055
What we're going to learn in Episode 23,
it's still lost in chaos.

24:34.139 --> 24:36.933
This is Dorohedoro!
